        "Adapted from 03_county_eda.ipynb. Historical county rainfall statistics from the supplied "
        "county_static.csv, joined by five-digit FIPS to the supplied 2022 CDC/ATSDR SVI county list. "
        "Rainfall reference period: 2000–2008 (confirmed by the data/model team). "
        "The supplied NOAA-based rainfall statistics cover 356 of 534 counties/parishes across TX, LA, MS, AL and FL. "
